    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797570/extras/9f7c2f70f2de36a763cbed9be073af32.avif?t=1738462928\" width=616 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Own Village from Scratch!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Craft Lands&quot;</strong> is a <strong>sandbox simulation game</strong> where you cultivate an empty land by planting trees, gathering resources, and developing a thriving village.<br>What starts as a barren wasteland can transform into a prosperous settlement\u2014<strong>all in your hands!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather Resources and Expand Your Village!</strong><br>Plant trees, harvest wood, and use resources to build houses for your villagers. As your village grows, more residents will move in, making it livelier and more dynamic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend Your Village from Enemies!</strong><br>But watch out! Your peaceful settlement may come under attack by <strong>mysterious enemies</strong>.<br>Build <strong>watchtowers</strong> and arm your villagers to <strong>defend your home</strong> against incoming threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create a Beautiful and Comfortable Living Space!</strong><br>Houses alone won\u2019t keep your villagers happy. <strong>Build parks, public squares, and lush forests</strong> to improve their quality of life and make your village truly unique.<br>How your village develops is entirely up to you\u2014<strong>unleash your creativity!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of village will you build?<br>Dive into the world of <strong>&quot;Craft Lands&quot;</strong> and start creating <strong>your own thriving settlement today!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797570/extras/9f7c2f70f2de36a763cbed9be073af32.avif?t=1738462928\" width=616 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Own Village from Scratch!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Craft Lands&quot;</strong> is a <strong>sandbox simulation game</strong> where you cultivate an empty land by planting trees, gathering resources, and developing a thriving village.<br>What starts as a barren wasteland can transform into a prosperous settlement\u2014<strong>all in your hands!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather Resources and Expand Your Village!</strong><br>Plant trees, harvest wood, and use resources to build houses for your villagers. As your village grows, more residents will move in, making it livelier and more dynamic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend Your Village from Enemies!</strong><br>But watch out! Your peaceful settlement may come under attack by <strong>mysterious enemies</strong>.<br>Build <strong>watchtowers</strong> and arm your villagers to <strong>defend your home</strong> against incoming threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create a Beautiful and Comfortable Living Space!</strong><br>Houses alone won\u2019t keep your villagers happy. <strong>Build parks, public squares, and lush forests</strong> to improve their quality of life and make your village truly unique.<br>How your village develops is entirely up to you\u2014<strong>unleash your creativity!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of village will you build?<br>Dive into the world of <strong>&quot;Craft Lands&quot;</strong> and start creating <strong>your own thriving settlement today!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Let's develop the village! Craft Lands is a development simulation game where you plant trees in a vast empty space and develop a village. Defend your village from enemies and use resources to build houses and increase your population. What kind of village you create is entirely up to you.",
